.TH PWRITEV 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
pwritev \- Linux x86-64 syscall 296
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_260_299.h>
.B ssize_t pwritev(int descriptor, const struct iovec* vectors, int count, off_t offset);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Writes vectors at a 64-bit offset without changing the file position. The wrapper splits the offset into kernel low and high words.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pwritev (2)
